msgid "# Non-Contiguous KV Cache"
msgstr "# 非连续 KV 缓存"

msgid "## 1. Overview"
msgstr "## 1. 概述"

msgid ""
"vLLM normally exposes a logical KV-cache block as a regular tensor view. On\n"
"Ascend, hybrid models can allocate Attention and Mamba cache groups from a\n"
"common page-aligned cache pool. A physical page may contain alignment padding\n"
"and different cache views may use different regions or backing tensors, so\n"
"treating every cache as a dense K/V tensor can waste memory or produce an\n"
"incorrect stride."
msgstr ""
"vLLM 通常将逻辑 KV 缓存块暴露为常规张量视图。在昇腾上，混合模型可以从一个公共的页对齐缓存池中分配 Attention 和 Mamba "
"缓存组。一个物理页可能包含对齐填充，不同的缓存视图可能使用不同的区域或底层张量，因此将每个缓存都视为稠密的 K/V 张量可能会浪费内存或产生错误的步长。"

msgid ""
"This feature keeps the logical block table and block IDs unchanged while\n"
"constructing strided tensor views over the existing physical allocation. It is\n"
"implemented in Model Runner V1 and applies to hybrid Attention + Mamba models\n"
"and supported pure GQA Attention models."
msgstr ""
"该特性在保持逻辑块表和块 ID 不变的同时，在现有物理分配之上构建带步长的张量视图。它在 Model Runner V1 中实现，适用于混合 "
"Attention + Mamba 模型以及受支持的纯 GQA Attention 模型。"

msgid "## 2. Goals and Non-Goals"
msgstr "## 2. 目标与非目标"

msgid "The implementation aims to:"
msgstr "该实现旨在："

msgid ""
"- preserve vLLM's logical block and block-table semantics;\n"
"- avoid copying padded pages into a dense K/V allocation;\n"
"- expose correct shape, stride, and storage-offset metadata to Ascend kernels;\n"
"- support separate Attention and Mamba cache groups in one allocation plan;\n"
"- make the layout observable through temporary debug logs."
msgstr ""
"- 保留 vLLM 的逻辑块和块表语义；\n"
"- 避免将填充页复制到稠密的 K/V 分配中；\n"
"- 向昇腾内核暴露正确的形状、步长和存储偏移元数据；\n"
"- 在一个分配方案中支持独立的 Attention 和 Mamba 缓存组；\n"
"- 通过临时调试日志使布局可观测。"

msgid ""
"It does not change token scheduling, block-table numbering, or the logical\n"
"Attention/Mamba cache specifications."
msgstr "它不改变 token 调度、块表编号或逻辑 Attention/Mamba 缓存规格。"

msgid "## 3. Physical and Logical Layout"
msgstr "## 3. 物理布局与逻辑布局"

msgid ""
"A logical block is the unit addressed by the scheduler. A physical page is the\n"
"byte range reserved by the allocator. Their sizes can differ when a page is\n"
"aligned for a hybrid cache group."
msgstr "逻辑块是调度器寻址的单位。物理页是分配器预留的字节范围。当页为混合缓存组进行对齐时，它们的大小可能不同。"

msgid ""
"For an Attention cache, the raw allocation is viewed as a block-major tensor.\n"
"When the physical page contains padding, the view uses a block stride based on\n"
"the full page size rather than the unpadded logical tensor size:"
msgstr "对于 Attention 缓存，原始分配被视为块主序张量。当物理页包含填充时，视图使用基于完整页大小的块步长，而不是未填充的逻辑张量大小："

msgid ""
"The view is non-contiguous by design. K and V remain separate logical views,\n"
"even when they share the same backing allocation."
msgstr "该视图在设计上就是非连续的。即使 K 和 V 共享同一底层分配，它们仍保持为独立的逻辑视图。"

msgid "### 3.1 Contiguous Compatibility Layout"
msgstr "### 3.1 连续兼容布局"

msgid ""
"The following layout is the legacy compatibility path used when the\n"
"implementation needs all state tensors to remain contiguous:"
msgstr "以下布局是当实现需要所有状态张量保持连续时使用的旧版兼容路径："

msgid ""
"This diagram must not be interpreted as the non-contiguous layout. It describes\n"
"how the physical buffer is split when padding is materialized explicitly."
msgstr "此图不得被解释为非连续布局。它描述的是当填充被显式实体化时物理缓冲区如何被拆分。"

msgid "### 3.2 Non-Contiguous Layout"
msgstr "### 3.2 非连续布局"

msgid ""
"The non-contiguous path does not require K, V, convolution state, and SSM state\n"
"to be concatenated into one logical tensor. Instead, each cache group is\n"
"exposed through its own view:"
msgstr "非连续路径不要求将 K、V、卷积状态和 SSM 状态拼接为一个逻辑张量。相反，每个缓存组通过其各自的视图暴露："

msgid ""
"The views can have different shapes, strides, and storage offsets. They use the\n"
"same logical block numbering and, where the cache pool requires it, the same\n"
"physical page stride. The implementation must not assume that an Attention K\n"
"region, an Mamba SSM region, and an Attention V region are always adjacent or\n"
"interleaved within one raw tensor."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Whether two layers share a backing tensor is determined by the cache allocator\n"
"and layer mapping. A shared backing tensor is interpreted through the existing\n"
"shared-layout path; otherwise each layer receives its own strided view."
msgstr "两个层是否共享底层张量由缓存分配器和层映射决定。共享的底层张量通过现有的共享布局路径进行解释；否则每个层获得其各自的带步长视图。"

msgid "### 3.3 Layout Comparison"
msgstr "### 3.3 布局对比"

msgid "| Aspect | Contiguous compatibility path | Non-contiguous path |"
msgstr "| 方面 | 连续兼容路径 | 非连续路径 |"

msgid ""
"| K/V representation | Dense or explicitly sliced tensors | Independent "
"strided K/V views |"
msgstr "| K/V 表示 | 稠密或显式切片的张量 | 独立的带步长 K/V 视图 |"

msgid ""
"| Mamba state representation | Explicitly split padded regions | Views "
"advanced by physical page stride |"
msgstr "| Mamba 状态表示 | 显式拆分的填充区域 | 按物理页步长推进的视图 |"

msgid ""
"| Padding | Materialized as tensor regions | Skipped by stride or storage "
"offset |"
msgstr "| 填充 | 实体化为张量区域 | 通过步长或存储偏移跳过 |"

msgid ""
"| Data movement | May require a dense staging view | Designed to avoid a "
"full-page copy |"
msgstr "| 数据移动 | 可能需要稠密的暂存视图 | 设计为避免整页复制 |"

msgid ""
"| Main invariant | Keep every state tensor contiguous | Preserve the "
"physical allocation and correct strides |"
msgstr "| 主要不变量 | 保持每个状态张量连续 | 保留物理分配和正确的步长 |"

msgid ""
"The two paths use the same logical block IDs, but they do not have the same\n"
"physical interpretation. A change to the contiguous compatibility layout must\n"
"not be used as evidence about the non-contiguous layout."
msgstr "这两条路径使用相同的逻辑块 ID，但它们不具有相同的物理解释。对连续兼容布局的更改不得用作关于非连续布局的证据。"

msgid "### 3.4 Example: Block Stride"
msgstr "### 3.4 示例：块步长"

msgid ""
"Assume a logical Attention block contains 48 `float16` elements, while the\n"
"hybrid page is aligned to 128 bytes:"
msgstr "假设一个逻辑 Attention 块包含 48 个 `float16` 元素，而混合页对齐到 128 字节："

msgid ""
"The next logical block therefore starts 64 elements after the current block,\n"
"not 48 elements after it. The 16-element gap is not part of the logical view."
msgstr "因此下一个逻辑块从当前块之后 64 个元素处开始，而不是之后 48 个元素处。这 16 个元素的间隙不属于逻辑视图的一部分。"

msgid ""
"For a combined K/V allocation, a simplified two-lane view can be represented\n"
"as:"
msgstr "对于合并的 K/V 分配，简化的双通道视图可以表示为："

msgid ""
"The first lane addresses K and the second lane addresses V. The lane stride and\n"
"the block stride are derived from the physical allocation; they are not inferred\n"
"from the logical tensor size alone."
msgstr "第一个通道寻址 K，第二个通道寻址 V。通道步长和块步长源自物理分配；它们不能仅从逻辑张量大小推断。"

msgid "## 4. Cache Construction Flow"
msgstr "## 4. 缓存构建流程"

msgid ""
"`NPUModelRunner._reshape_kv_cache_tensors` performs the following steps:"
msgstr "`NPUModelRunner._reshape_kv_cache_tensors` 执行以下步骤："

msgid ""
"1. Read the logical `KVCacheSpec` for each cache group.\n"
"2. Select the kernel block size for the group.\n"
"3. Identify whether the raw allocation is a separate K/V tuple, a combined\n"
"   tensor, or a Mamba state allocation.\n"
"4. Build typed views with `view`, `as_strided`, or the existing Ascend layout\n"
"   helper without copying the backing storage.\n"
"5. Preserve the logical layer-to-cache mapping used by the worker."
msgstr ""
"1. 读取每个缓存组的逻辑 `KVCacheSpec`。\n"
"2. 为该组选择内核块大小。\n"
"3. 识别原始分配是独立的 K/V 元组、合并张量还是 Mamba 状态分配。\n"
"4. 使用 `view`、`as_strided` 或现有的昇腾布局辅助函数构建类型化视图，而不复制底层存储。\n"
"5. 保留 worker 使用的逻辑层到缓存的映射。"

msgid "The relevant implementation points are:"
msgstr "相关的实现要点包括："

msgid ""
"The scheduler continues to operate on logical block IDs. These helpers only\n"
"change how a worker maps a logical ID to a physical address."
msgstr "调度器继续基于逻辑块 ID 运行。这些辅助函数仅改变 worker 将逻辑 ID 映射到物理地址的方式。"

msgid ""
"Hybrid Attention uses the common hybrid allocation contract when\n"
"`use_hybrid_blocks` is enabled. Pure GQA Attention can use the block-major\n"
"non-contiguous view without requiring a Mamba layer in the same model."
msgstr ""
"当启用 `use_hybrid_blocks` 时，混合 Attention 使用通用的混合分配约定。纯 GQA Attention "
"可以使用块主序非连续视图，而无需在同一模型中包含 Mamba 层。"

msgid "## 5. Mamba State Access"
msgstr "## 5. Mamba 状态访问"

msgid ""
"Mamba convolution and SSM states can have a physical stride larger than their\n"
"logical row size. The Mamba state helpers therefore gather the requested rows\n"
"into a kernel-friendly tensor and scatter updates back to the original strided\n"
"allocation."
msgstr ""
"Mamba 卷积和 SSM 状态的物理 stride 可能大于其逻辑行大小。因此，Mamba 状态辅助函数会将请求的行收集到对 kernel "
"友好的张量中，并将更新散射回原始的带 stride 分配。"

msgid "The gather/scatter path preserves:"
msgstr "gather/scatter 路径保留以下内容："

msgid ""
"- the request-to-state index mapping;\n"
"- the `has_initial_state` mask;\n"
"- the storage padding between physical pages;\n"
"- in-place updates of the original cache allocation."
msgstr ""
"- 请求到状态的索引映射；\n"
"- `has_initial_state` 掩码；\n"
"- 物理页之间的存储填充；\n"
"- 原始缓存分配的就地更新。"

msgid ""
"The state index tests cover both zero padding and padded physical rows."
msgstr "状态索引测试覆盖零填充和填充的物理行两种情况。"

msgid "The access flow is therefore:"
msgstr "因此，访问流程如下："

msgid "## 6. FLA Operator Integration"
msgstr "## 6. FLA 算子集成"

msgid ""
"The standard GDN preprocessing and recurrent paths use the FLA AscendC\n"
"interfaces:"
msgstr "标准 GDN 预处理和循环路径使用 FLA AscendC 接口："

msgid ""
"The FLA tests use independent PyTorch golden implementations and are placed\n"
"outside the vLLM-Ascend `e2e` and `ops` conftest trees. This prevents unrelated\n"
"Triton/custom-op initialization from changing the FLA runtime state in the\n"
"same process."
msgstr ""
"FLA 测试使用独立的 PyTorch 黄金实现，并放置在 vLLM-Ascend `e2e` 和 `ops` conftest "
"树之外。这可以防止无关的 Triton/自定义算子初始化在同一进程中改变 FLA 运行时状态。"

msgid "## 7. Observability"
msgstr "## 7. 可观测性"

msgid ""
"While the layout is still under validation, Model Runner emits debug messages\n"
"with the following prefix:"
msgstr "在布局仍处于验证阶段时，Model Runner 会发出带有以下前缀的调试消息："

msgid ""
"Attention logs include the mode (`hybrid` or `gqa`), shape, stride, and K/V\n"
"contiguity. Mamba logs include page size, state shapes, strides, storage\n"
"offsets, and contiguity. These logs are temporary observation points and can be\n"
"removed after the layout implementation is considered stable."
msgstr ""
"Attention 日志包含模式（`hybrid` 或 `gqa`）、形状、stride 以及 K/V 连续性。Mamba "
"日志包含页大小、状态形状、stride、存储偏移和连续性。这些日志是临时的观测点，在布局实现被认为稳定后可以移除。"

msgid "## 8. Compatibility and Limitations"
msgstr "## 8. 兼容性与限制"

msgid ""
"- The feature is implemented for Model Runner V1 cache construction.\n"
"- The logical block table and scheduler-visible block IDs remain unchanged.\n"
"- The exact physical layout depends on the model's Attention and Mamba cache\n"
"  specifications and the selected kernel block sizes.\n"
"- Sparse, compressed, offloaded, or connector-specific cache paths must retain\n"
"  their own layout contracts; they should not be assumed to accept a strided\n"
"  view without dedicated validation.\n"
"- Graph capture, PD disaggregation, and KV connectors require end-to-end\n"
"  validation for each supported configuration."
msgstr ""
"- 该功能针对 Model Runner V1 缓存构建实现。\n"
"- 逻辑块表和调度器可见的块 ID 保持不变。\n"
"- 确切的物理布局取决于模型的 Attention 和 Mamba 缓存规格以及所选 kernel 块大小。\n"
"- 稀疏、压缩、卸载或连接器特定的缓存路径必须保留各自的布局契约；不应在没有专门验证的情况下假定它们接受带 stride 的视图。\n"
"- 图捕获、PD 分离和 KV 连接器需要针对每个支持的配置进行端到端验证。"

msgid ""
"When a path uses a connector, sparse cache, compressed cache, or offload\n"
"backend, its registration and transfer contract may impose a separate physical\n"
"layout. The non-contiguous view must not be enabled for that path solely because\n"
"the model is a hybrid or GQA model; the connector-specific path needs its own\n"
"validation."
msgstr ""
"当某条路径使用连接器、稀疏缓存、压缩缓存或卸载后端时，其注册和传输契约可能会施加单独的物理布局。不能仅因为模型是混合或 GQA "
"模型就为该路径启用非连续视图；连接器特定的路径需要其自身的验证。"

msgid "## 9. Testing"
msgstr "## 9. 测试"

msgid "The PR covers the following test categories:"
msgstr "该 PR 涵盖以下测试类别："

msgid ""
"- Model Runner unit tests for hybrid and pure-GQA cache views;\n"
"- Mamba state gather/scatter tests, including physical padding;\n"
"- FLA causal convolution and recurrent GDN numerical tests;\n"
"- GDN layerwise KV connector tests with FLA operator mocks;\n"
"- debug-log assertions confirming hybrid and GQA non-contiguous layouts."
msgstr ""
"- 针对混合和纯 GQA 缓存视图的 Model Runner 单元测试；\n"
"- Mamba 状态 gather/scatter 测试，包括物理填充；\n"
"- FLA 因果卷积和循环 GDN 数值测试；\n"
"- 使用 FLA 算子 mock 的 GDN 逐层 KV 连接器测试；\n"
"- 确认混合和 GQA 非连续布局的调试日志断言。"

msgid "The intended validation matrix is:"
msgstr "预期的验证矩阵如下："

msgid "| Area | Cases |"
msgstr "| 领域 | 用例 |"

msgid ""
"| Cache construction | Hybrid Attention + Mamba; pure GQA; padded pages; "
"combined K/V allocation |"
msgstr "| 缓存构建 | 混合 Attention + Mamba；纯 GQA；填充页；组合 K/V 分配 |"

msgid ""
"| State access | Zero padding; non-zero padding; indexed gather; in-place "
"scatter |"
msgstr "| 状态访问 | 零填充；非零填充；索引 gather；就地 scatter |"

msgid ""
"| FLA operators | `causal_conv1d_fn`; `causal_conv1d_update`; "
"`recurrent_gated_delta_rule` |"
msgstr ""
"| FLA 算子 | "
"`causal_conv1d_fn`；`causal_conv1d_update`；`recurrent_gated_delta_rule` |"

msgid ""
"| Execution modes | Eager execution; graph capture after the layout is "
"enabled |"
msgstr "| 执行模式 | 即时执行；启用布局后的图捕获 |"

msgid ""
"| Scheduling | Prefill; decode; MTP/speculative metadata where the model "
"path enables it |"
msgstr "| 调度 | Prefill；decode；模型路径启用时的 MTP/投机元数据 |"

msgid ""
"| Distributed paths | PD disaggregation and KV connectors only after their "
"transfer layout is validated |"
msgstr "| 分布式路径 | 仅在其传输布局经过验证后的 PD 分离和 KV 连接器 |"

msgid ""
"The unit tests validate shapes, strides, storage offsets, and dispatch metadata.\n"
"FLA single-operator numerical tests are maintained in the FLA repository.\n"
"The Ascend nightly state-index tests compare the local Triton helpers against\n"
"PyTorch references, including unselected rows and physical page padding.\n"
"End-to-end model tests are still required for each\n"
"graph, connector, and distributed configuration claimed as supported."
msgstr ""
"单元测试验证形状、stride、存储偏移和调度元数据。\n"
"FLA 单算子数值测试维护在 FLA 仓库中。\n"
"昇腾 nightly 状态索引测试将本地 Triton 辅助函数与 PyTorch 参考实现进行比较，包括未选中的行和物理页填充。\n"
"对于声称支持的每种图、连接器和分布式配置，仍需要进行端到端模型测试。"

msgid "Representative NPU commands are:"
msgstr "代表性的 NPU 命令如下："
